With a .booping marker above the cwd the run appends exactly one [frontmatter-update] line, naming the plan and the changed keys, to the attached vault's log.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/probe/index.md --
---
status: draft
title: Probe plan
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update vault/plans/probe/index.md status=ready
-- stdout --
--- vault/plans/probe/index.md
+++ vault/plans/probe/index.md
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 ---
-status: draft
+status: ready
 title: Probe plan
 ---
 
-- stderr --
updated vault/plans/probe/index.md: status=ready
-- expected/cwd/vault/.booping.log --
[..]Z: [frontmatter-update] vault/plans/probe/index.md status
-- expected/cwd/vault/plans/probe/index.md --
---
status: ready
title: Probe plan
---

Body.
-- exit --
0
